WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.396
Find out why you keep missing.

00:00:02.833 --> 00:00:10.171
Technique Doctor reads your bar traces and your miss tags. Then it names the fault that keeps showing up.

00:00:10.633 --> 00:00:16.206
Each fault comes with a cue for your next rep. You also see the dates of the lifts that show it.

00:00:16.667 --> 00:00:24.608
Browse every fault by lift. See the likely causes and the drills that fix them. It tells you where to film it, too.

00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:36.213
Free reads your last five lifts. Pro reads further back, so you can watch a fault shrink. Here, arms bent early fell from seventy-six to sixty-two percent.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:41.079
Download Barforge Weightlifting. No account. Free to start.
